Wrap navigator.clipboard.writeText() in VoiceOfCustomer.jsx copyEmail() with try/catch + fallback. Example:
  const copyEmail = async () => {
    if (!outreach) return;
    const text = `${outreach.subject}\n\n${outreach.email}`;
    try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); }
    catch { /* fallback: create hidden textarea, select, document.execCommand('copy') */ }
    setCopied(true);
    setTimeout(() => setCopied(false), 1600);
  };
This will stop the CRA overlay from firing in the Emergent preview iframe and in any browser where Clipboard API is denied.
